---
/**
 * ELB（Elastic Load Balancing）解説ダイアグラム
 * トラフィック分散の仕組みと ALB / NLB / GWLB の比較
 */
---

<style>
  /* コンポーネント固有: ELB diagram */
  .elb-section-title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  /* Overview: fan-out grid */
  .elb-overview-wrap {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0;
    padding: 16px;
  }
  .elb-overview-wrap .dia-row { width: 100%; }
  .elb-targets { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 24px; }

  /* SVG overlay */
  .elb-svg-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0;
    width: 100%; height: 100%;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 10;
    overflow: visible;
  }

  /* ALB target groups */
  .elb-alb-targets {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .elb-alb-tg {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    min-width: 160px;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .elb-alb-tg-label { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
  .elb-alb-tg-sub { font-size: 12px; margin-top: 4px; }
  .elb-alb-tg-icons { display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-top: 8px; }
  .elb-alb-tg-icons img { width: 28px; height: 28px; }

  /* NLB split */
  .elb-nlb-split { display: flex; gap: 16px; margin-top: 8px; }
  .elb-nlb-col {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 14px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .elb-nlb-col-title { font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .elb-nlb-good { background: #ecfdf5; border: 1px solid #10b981; }
  .elb-nlb-good .elb-nlb-col-title { color: #065f46; }
  .elb-nlb-good li { color: #065f46; }
  .dark .elb-nlb-good { background: rgba(5,150,105,.15); border-color: #34d399; }
  .dark .elb-nlb-good .elb-nlb-col-title { color: #6ee7b7; }
  .dark .elb-nlb-good li { color: #6ee7b7; }
  .elb-nlb-bad { background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #f87171; }
  .elb-nlb-bad .elb-nlb-col-title { color: #991b1b; }
  .elb-nlb-bad li { color: #991b1b; }
  .dark .elb-nlb-bad { background: rgba(220,38,38,.15); border-color: #f87171; }
  .dark .elb-nlb-bad .elb-nlb-col-title { color: #fca5a5; }
  .dark .elb-nlb-bad li { color: #fca5a5; }
  .elb-nlb-col ul { padding-left: 18px; margin: 0; }

  /* Terms: hierarchical flow */
  .elb-terms-wrap {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    padding: 16px;
  }
  .elb-terms-cols {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .elb-terms-branch {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0;
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 280px;
  }
  .elb-tg-group {
    border: 1px dashed #d1d5db;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 10px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .dark .elb-tg-group { border-color: #4b5563; }
  .elb-tg-group-title { font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; font-weight: 500; }
  .dark .elb-tg-group-title { color: #9ca3af; }
  .elb-tg-icons { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
  .elb-healthcheck {
    font-size: 11px;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #eaf3de;
    border: 1px solid #3b6d11;
    color: #27500a;
  }
  .dark .elb-healthcheck {
    background: rgba(59,109,17,.2);
    border-color: #65a30d;
    color: #bef264;
  }
  /* ヘルスチェックボックス（SVG準拠デザイン） */
  .elb-healthcheck-box {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: #dcfce7;
    border: 1px solid #16a34a;
    color: #166534;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .dark .elb-healthcheck-box {
    background: rgba(22,163,74,.15);
    border-color: #4ade80;
    color: #bbf7d0;
  }

  /* Terms: legend bar */
  .elb-terms-legend {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #fefce8;
    border: 1px solid #fde047;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .dark .elb-terms-legend {
    background: rgba(250,204,21,.08);
    border-color: #ca8a04;
  }
  .elb-terms-legend-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
  .elb-terms-legend-dot {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 10px; height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .elb-terms-legend-name { font-weight: 600; }
  .elb-terms-legend-desc { color: #854d0e; }
  .dark .elb-terms-legend-desc { color: #fef9c3; }

  /* Redirect box */
  .elb-redirect {
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #fefce8;
    border: 1px solid #fde047;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .dark .elb-redirect {
    background: rgba(250,204,21,.1);
    border-color: #ca8a04;
  }
  .elb-redirect-title { font-weight: 600; color: #854d0e; }
  .dark .elb-redirect-title { color: #fde047; }
  .elb-redirect-sub { font-size: 12px; color: #a16207; margin-top: 2px; }
  .dark .elb-redirect-sub { color: #fef9c3; }

  /* Routing: 3-column layout */
  .elb-routing-wrap {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 0;
    padding: 16px;
  }
  .elb-routing-left,
  .elb-routing-right {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 220px;
  }
  .elb-routing-center {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0 8px;
    min-width: 100px;
  }
  .elb-routing-item {
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .elb-routing-item-label { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
  .elb-routing-item-sub { font-size: 11px; margin-top: 2px; }

  /* ALB feature list */
  .elb-feature-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 2;
  }
  .elb-feature-list li::before { content: "・"; }

  /* SSL/TLS diagram */
  .elb-ssl-btn {
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 12px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    background: #f9fafb;
    color: #111827;
    font-family: inherit;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .dark .elb-ssl-btn {
    border-color: #374151;
    background: #1f2937;
    color: #f9fafb;
  }
  .elb-ssl-btn:hover {
    background: #f3f4f6;
  }
  .dark .elb-ssl-btn:hover {
    background: #374151;
  }
  .elb-ssl-btn.active {
    background: #534ab7;
    color: #fff;
    border-color: #534ab7;
  }

  .elb-ssl-diagram {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0;
    padding: 24px 16px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .elb-ssl-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .elb-ssl-arrow {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0 8px;
    min-width: 80px;
  }
  .elb-ssl-proto {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .elb-ssl-proto.https {
    background: #d1fae5;
    color: #065f46;
  }
  .dark .elb-ssl-proto.https {
    background: rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.3);
    color: #6ee7b7;
  }
  .elb-ssl-proto.http {
    background: #fef2f2;
    color: #991b1b;
  }
  .dark .elb-ssl-proto.http {
    background: rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.2);
    color: #fca5a5;
  }
  .elb-ssl-arrow-line {
    width: 60px;
    height: 3px;
    background: #9ca3af;
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .elb-ssl-arrow-line::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    right: -4px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    border: 5px solid transparent;
    border-left-color: #9ca3af;
  }
  .elb-ssl-lock {
    position: absolute;
    top: -18px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .elb-ssl-lock.hidden {
    display: none;
  }
  .elb-ssl-cert {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-top: 8px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    background: #fef3c7;
    border: 1px solid #f59e0b;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #92400e;
  }
  .dark .elb-ssl-cert {
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
    border-color: #fbbf24;
    color: #fcd34d;
  }
  .elb-ssl-cert.hidden {
    visibility: hidden;
  }
  .elb-ssl-ec2-group {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .elb-ssl-compare {
    margin-top: 16px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  /* SNI Section */
  .elb-sni-section {
    border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    padding-top: 16px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .dark .elb-sni-section {
    border-color: #374151;
  }
  .elb-sni-diagram {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .elb-sni-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .elb-sni-domains {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .elb-sni-domain {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    background: #eff6ff;
    border: 1px solid #3b82f6;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .dark .elb-sni-domain {
    background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
    border-color: #60a5fa;
  }
  .elb-sni-domain-name {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #1d4ed8;
  }
  .dark .elb-sni-domain-name {
    color: #93c5fd;
  }
  .elb-sni-lock {
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .elb-sni-arrow {
    font-size: 24px;
    color: #9ca3af;
  }
  .elb-sni-certs {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    max-width: 200px;
  }
  .elb-sni-targets {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .elb-sni-compare {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
</style>

<div>
  <!-- Tabs -->
  <div class="tab-btn-group">
     <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="elbTab('overview', event)">ELB概要</button>
     <button class="tab-btn" onclick="elbTab('alb', event)">ALB</button>
     <button class="tab-btn" onclick="elbTab('nlb', event)">NLB</button>
     <button class="tab-btn" onclick="elbTab('terms', event)">基本用語</button>
     <button class="tab-btn" onclick="elbTab('routing', event)">ALBルーティング詳細</button>
     <button class="tab-btn" onclick="elbTab('compare', event)">使い分け</button>
     <button class="tab-btn" onclick="elbTab('ssl', event)">SSL/TLS暗号化</button>
  </div>

  <!-- ========== Tab 1: ELB Overview ========== -->
  <div id="elb-overview" class="tab-panel active">
    <div class="elb-section-title">ELB：トラフィックを複数のターゲットに自動分散</div>
    <div class="elb-overview-wrap" id="elb-ov-wrap">
      <!-- SVG overlay -->
      <svg id="elb-ov-svg" class="elb-svg-overlay">
        <defs>
          <marker id="elb-ah" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
            <path d="M2 1L8 5L2 9" fill="none" stroke="context-stroke" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </marker>
        </defs>
        <line id="elb-ov-a0" stroke="#888780" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#elb-ah)"/>
        <path id="elb-ov-a1" fill="none" stroke="#534AB7" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#elb-ah)"/>
        <path id="elb-ov-a2" fill="none" stroke="#534AB7" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#elb-ah)"/>
        <path id="elb-ov-a3" fill="none" stroke="#534AB7" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#elb-ah)"/>
      </svg>

      <!-- User -->
      <div class="dia-row">
        <div id="elb-ov-user" class="dia-box dia-internet">
          <img class="dia-box-icon" src="/AWS-icons/Resource-Icons_07312025/Res_General-Icons/Res_48_Light/Res_Users_48_Light.svg" alt="Users"/>
          <div class="dia-box-label">ユーザー</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dia-row" style="height:40px;"></div>

      <!-- ELB -->
      <div class="dia-row">
        <div id="elb-ov-elb" class="dia-box dia-elb">
          <img class="dia-box-icon" src="/AWS-icons/Architecture-Service-Icons_07312025/Arch_Networking-Content-Delivery/48/Arch_Elastic-Load-Balancing_48.svg" alt="ELB"/>
          <div class="dia-box-label">ELB</div>
          <div class="dia-box-sub">ヘルスチェックで異常インスタンスを自動除外</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dia-row" style="height:40px;"></div>

      <!-- EC2 targets -->
      <div class="dia-row">
        <div class="elb-targets">
          <div id="elb-ov-ec2a" class="dia-box dia-ec2">
            <img class="dia-box-icon" src="/AWS-icons/Architecture-Service-Icons_07312025/Arch_Compute/48/Arch_Amazon-EC2_48.svg" alt="EC2"/>
            <div class="dia-box-label">EC2-1</div>
          </div>
          <div id="elb-ov-ec2b" class="dia-box dia-ec2">
            <img class="dia-box-icon" src="/AWS-icons/Architecture-Service-Icons_07312025/Arch_Compute/48/Arch_Amazon-EC2_48.svg" alt="EC2"/>
            <div class="dia-box-label">EC2-2</div>
          </div>
          <div id="elb-ov-ec2c" class="dia-box dia-ec2">
            <img class="dia-box-icon" src="/AWS-icons/Architecture-Service-Icons_07312025/Arch_Compute/48/Arch_Amazon-EC2_48.svg" alt="EC2"/>
            <div class="dia-box-label">EC2-3</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dia-note warn" style="margin-top:12px;">
      <strong>ELBの3種類：</strong>ALB（L7・HTTP）/ NLB（L4・TCP/UDP・固定IP）/ GWLB（L3-4・FW統合）
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ========== Tab 2: ALB ========== -->
  <div id="elb-alb" class="tab-panel">
    <div class="elb-section-title">ALB：L7でパスやホストヘッダーによるルーティング</div>

    <div class="dia-diagram">
      <!-- ALB box -->
      <div class="dia-row">
        <div class="dia-box dia-elb" style="min-width:280px;">
          <img class="dia-box-icon" src="/AWS-icons/Resource-Icons_07312025/Res_Networking-Content-Delivery/Res_Elastic-Load-Balancing_Application-Load-Balancer_48.svg" alt="ALB"/>
          <div class="dia-box-label">ALB（Application Load Balancer）</div>
          <div class="dia-box-sub">リスナー → ルール → ターゲットグループ → ヘルスチェック</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dia-row">
        <div class="dia-arrow"><div class="dia-arrow-v green"></div></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Target groups -->
      <div class="elb-alb-targets">
        <div class="elb-alb-tg dia-igw">
          <div class="elb-alb-tg-label" style="color:#065f46;">/api/* → APIサーバー</div>
          <div class="elb-alb-tg-icons">
            <img src="/AWS-icons/Architecture-Service-Icons_07312025/Arch_Compute/48/Arch_Amazon-EC2_48.svg" alt="EC2" title="EC2"/>
            <img src="/AWS-icons/Architecture-Service-Icons_07312025/Arch_Compute/48/Arch_AWS-Lambda_48.svg" alt="Lambda" title="Lambda"/>
            <img src="/AWS-icons/Architecture-Service-Icons_07312025/Arch_Containers/48/Arch_Amazon-Elastic-Container-Service_48.svg" alt="ECS" title="ECS"/>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="elb-alb-tg dia-igw">
          <div class="elb-alb-tg-label" style="color:#065f46;">/web/* → Webサーバー</div>
          <div class="elb-alb-tg-icons">
            <img src="/AWS-icons/Architecture-Service-Icons_07312025/Arch_Compute/48/Arch_Amazon-EC2_48.svg" alt="EC2" title="EC2"/>
            <img src="/AWS-icons/Architecture-Service-Icons_07312025/Arch_Containers/48/Arch_Amazon-Elastic-Container-Service_48.svg" alt="ECS" title="ECS"/>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="elb-alb-tg" style="background:#fefce8;border:1px solid #fde047;">
          <div class="elb-alb-tg-label" style="color:#854d0e;">デフォルト → 固定レスポンス</div>
          <div class="elb-alb-tg-sub" style="color:#a16207;">404など</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Features -->
    <div class="dia-note info" style="margin-top:12px;">
      <strong>ALBの特徴</strong>
      <ul class="elb-feature-list">
        <li>パスベース / ホストベース / ヘッダー / クエリ文字列でルーティング</li>
        <li>Lambda をターゲットにできる（NLBはできない）</li>
        <li>WebSocket対応 / スティッキーセッション / SSL終端</li>
        <li>ACMで証明書管理（HTTPS対応）</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ========== Tab 3: NLB ========== -->
  <div id="elb-nlb" class="tab-panel">
    <div class="elb-section-title">NLB：L4・固定IP・超低レイテンシー</div>

    <div class="dia-diagram">
          <!-- ▼▼▼ ここからNLB説明追加（枠付き詳細） ▼▼▼ -->
    <div class="dia-note" style="margin-bottom:16px;">
    <!-- Features -->
    <div class="dia-note info" style="margin-top:12px;">
      <strong>NLBの特徴</strong>
      <ul class="elb-feature-list">
        <li>OSI第4層（L4）でTCP/UDP/TLSトラフィックを超低レイテンシーで分散</b>するロードバランサ。</li>
        <li>各AZごとに固定IP（静的IP/EIP）</b>を持ち、<b>1秒あたり数百万リクエスト</b>の高スループットに対応。</li>
        <li>ヘルスチェック</b>や<b>スティッキーセッション（ソースIP）</b>もサポート。</li>
        <li>HTTP/HTTPSの高度なルーティングやLambda連携は不可</b>だが、<b>ゲーム・金融・IoT・VoIPなど低遅延・固定IPが必要な用途</b>に最適。</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    </div>
    <!-- ▲▲▲ ここまでNLB説明追加 ▲▲▲ -->
      <div class="dia-row">
        <div class="dia-box dia-elb" style="min-width:280px;">
          <img class="dia-box-icon" src="/AWS-icons/Resource-Icons_07312025/Res_Networking-Content-Delivery/Res_Elastic-Load-Balancing_Network-Load-Balancer_48.svg" alt="NLB"/>
          <div class="dia-box-label">NLB（Network Load Balancer）</div>
          <div class="dia-box-sub">TCP/UDP/TLSをL4で処理・AZごとに静的IP（EIPも可）</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="elb-nlb-split">
      <div class="elb-nlb-col elb-nlb-good">
        <div class="elb-nlb-col-title">✅ 向いている用途</div>
        <ul>
          <li>ゲーム・金融・IoT・VoIP</li>
          <li>固定IPが必要なケース</li>
          <li>超低レイテンシーが必要</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="elb-nlb-col elb-nlb-bad">
        <div class="elb-nlb-col-title">✕ 向いていない用途</div>
        <ul>
          <li>パスルーティングが必要</li>
          <li>Lambdaをターゲットにしたい</li>
          <li>HTTPヘッダーでの振り分け</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="dia-note warn" style="margin-top:12px;">
      <strong>SAA頻出：</strong>「固定IPが必要」→ NLB　「パスで振り分け・Lambda」→ ALB
    </div>
  </div>

